# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A six-frame sprite as the focal animation, a still moon, and a pattern
# ramped to ember orange as the particles: fireflies, boxed to the column
# above the fire, become sparks drifting up out of it. The ground is a colour
# layer from row 30 down, so the fire sits on it at any panel height.
S - Campfire
U 32 32
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Night sky
I @pat/starfield-2d
C sliderMode 65536
L sprite 22 2 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Moon
I @spr/moon
L color 0 30 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Ground
K 0a0705
L pat 8 0 16 28 add 90 none fill 1
N Embers
I @pat/fireflies
C sliderFliesPer100Px 786432
C sliderLifetimeSeconds 98304
R 100 0:000000 255:ff9a3c
L sprite 8 17 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Fire
I @spr/campfire
